<title>DENMARK: Danish June wholesale prices up 2.1 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Danish June wholesale prices up 2.1 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Danish wholesale prices fell by 0.5 percent in June 1997 from May 1997 but were up 2.1 percent from June 1996, the national statistics office said on Friday.  </p>
<p>					 June 1997   May 1997  June 1996</p>
<p>    Change on month (percent)    -0.5	 +0.8	 -0.7</p>
<p>    Change on year (percent)     +2.1	 +1.9	 +0.9</p>
<p>    Index (base year 1990=100)  106.3	106.8	104.1</p>
<p>NOTE - The statistics office changed the index base year to 1990 from 1980, effective April 1994. Analysts had forecast an average 2.1 percent yr/yr WPI rise for June. --Chris Follett, Copenhagen newsroom +45-33-969652</p>
</text>
